# The Mermaid runtime bundle (lib/mermaid-runtime.js) is a generated build
# artifact, but it is COMMITTED on purpose so a cloned plugin works out of the
# box (offline rendering, no build step needed before `dsh plugin add`). CI
# rebuilds it with `npm run build` regardless.
